@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title 4.0 Submit Paper

actor "Visitor" as V
participant "System" as S
database "Database" as D
actor "Organizer" as O

== Cek Kelayakan ==

V -> S : Klik Submit Paper
S -> D : Cek status pendaftaran user
D --> S : Status pendaftaran lunas

== Submit Paper ==

V -> S : Isi data paper dan upload file PDF
S -> D : Simpan paper submission dengan status review
D --> S : Paper tersimpan
S --> V : Tampilkan pesan Paper berhasil dikirim

== Review Paper ==

O -> S : Review paper, accept atau reject
S -> D : Update status paper
D --> S : Status terupdate
S --> V : Kirim notifikasi status paper

@enduml
